# Elasticsearch overview cluster URL.
# This is a direct ES endpoint — NOT a Kibana URL.
# The overview cluster has CCS configured to all remote clusters, so the
# scanner discovers and queries them all through a single connection:
#   - The local cluster (queried directly)
#   - Any CCS remote clusters returned by GET _remote/info (connected=true)
#
# One ES URL per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Credentials are stored separately in api-keys.json (see auth.py).
#
# Example:
# https://overview.qa.cld.elstc.co
